 Number: HQ/07/073468). LS is Director of the Department of Neglected Tropical Diseases, WHO, Geneva. He had a role in the study design and preparation of the manuscript.</p></fn><fn id="n102" fn-type="conflict"><p><bold>Competing Interests:</bold> The authors have declared that no competing interests exist.</p></fn></fn-group></back></article>